=== /home/src/.config/quickshell/plugins/wallwatch/wallman.ms === .TLwallwatch(1) \- high\-performance wallpaper\-based theme generator.AUUser.AIComputer Science & Hardware Architecture Project.ND April 2026.SHNAME.PP.B wallwatch\- extract colors from images/video and generate harmonized Material Design 3 color schemes..SHSYNOPSIS.PP.B wallwatch[\fB\-w\fR \fIpath\fR] [\fB\-V\fR \fIvariant\fR] [\fB\-l\fR].SHDESCRIPTION.PP.B wallwatchis a specialized tool designed to bridge the gap between multimedia content and system aesthetics. It utilizes the OpenCV library for fast pixel extraction and the Material Color Utilities for generating mathematically accessible color palettes..PPThe tool is optimized for performance, achieving execution times as low as 21ms by utilizing manual argument parsing and efficient caching mechanisms..SHOPTIONS.PP.IP "\fB\-w, \-\-wallpaper\fR \fIpath\fR"The absolute or relative path to the source image or video file. Supports tilde (\(tl) expansion for home directories..IP "\fB\-V, \-\-variant\fR \fIvariant\fR"Specifies the Material Design 3 color strategy. Supported variants include:.RS.IP "\(bu" 6\fBvibrant\fR (Default).IP "\(bu" 6\fBtonal_spot\fR.IP "\(bu" 6\fBfidelity\fR.IP "\(bu" 6\fBfruit_salad\fR.IP "\(bu" 6\fBmonochrome\fR.IP "\(bu" 6\fBcontent\fR (Matches the image colors most accurately).RE.IP "\fB\-l, \-\-light\fR"Force the generation of a light mode scheme. If omitted, the program defaults to dark mode..SHCOLOR HARMONIZATION.PPUnlike standard generators that use static semantic colors, .B wallwatchimplements .I "Color Harmonization" .This process shifts the hue of "Success" and "Error" colors toward the source wallpaper's primary hue..PPThis ensures that UI elements remain functional while appearing visually integrated into the current atmosphere of the desktop environment..SHENVIRONMENT.PP.IP \fBSCRIPT_GEN\fRDirectory where the final \fIscheme.json\fR will be written. Defaults to \fI~/.local/share/wallscript/\fR..IP \fBWALL_CACHE\fRDirectory for storing pre-computed palettes. This significantly reduces CPU usage on repeated wallpaper selections..SHPERFORMANCE NOTES.PPThe application utilizes .B QtConcurrentto perform background library generation. While the primary theme is applied near-instantly (~20ms), all other possible variants are computed in the background and cached for future use without blocking the main execution thread..SHEXAMPLES.PPGenerate a dark vibrant theme from a wallpaper:.RS.B "wallwatch -w ~/Pictures/wall.png".RE.PPGenerate a light monochrome theme:.RS.B "wallwatch -w ~/Pictures/wall.png -V monochrome -l".RE.SHFILES.PP.I ~/.cache/wallwatch/wallcache/.RSStores the binary color data hashed by file content..RE.I ~/.local/share/wallscript/scheme.json.RSThe resulting JSON file containing hex codes for system-wide consumption..RE.SHBUGS.PPThe use of \fBstd::string_view\fR in the argument parser requires a C++20 compliant compiler.
